.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-INSTALL-ALIAS 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-install\-alias \- Add the qp alias beside the quipu binary
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu install\-alias\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-bin\-dir\fR] [\fB\-\-check\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add the qp alias beside the quipu binary
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-bin\-dir\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
